{"step_index":32,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T21:11:10Z","content":"Let me start executing the changes. I'll work through each logical commit sequentially.\n\n**Commit 1: Adopt glib.c as usb_node module**","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/*\n * usb_node.h – USB descriptor tree model.\n *\n * Provides UsbNode (tree of named properties) where each property (UsbProp)\n * can hold integers (u8/u16/u32), raw byte arrays, or nested child nodes.\n *\n * Usage: yaml_loader parses YAML into a UsbNode tree; yaml_backend serializes\n * the tree into binary USB descriptors.\n */\n\n#ifndef USB_NODE_H\n#define USB_NODE_H\n\n#include <glib.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n\ntypedef enum {\n    USB_PROP_UINT8,\n    USB_PROP_UINT16,\n    USB_PROP_UINT32,\n    USB_PROP_ARRAY,\n    USB_PROP_NODE,\n} UsbPropType;\n\ntypedef struct _UsbNode UsbNode;\n\ntypedef struct {\n    char        *name;\n    UsbPropType  type;\n    size_t       size;\n    union {\n        uint8_t   u8;\n        uint16_t  u16;\n        uint32_t  u32;\n        uint8_t  *array;\n        UsbNode  *node;\n    } val;\n} UsbProp;\n\nstruct _UsbNode {\n    GList *props;  /* list of UsbProp* */\n};\n\n/* ── Node constructors / destructors ── */\n\nUsbNode *usb_node_create(void);\nvoid     usb_node_free(UsbNode *node);\n\n/* ── Property constructors ── */\n\nUsbProp *create_prop_u8(const char *name, uint8_t val);\nUsbProp *create_prop_u16(const char *name, uint16_t val);\nUsbProp *create_prop_u32(const char *name, uint32_t val);\nUsbProp *create_prop_array(const char *name, const uint8_t *data, size_t len);\nUsbProp *create_prop_node(const char *name, UsbNode *child_node);\n\n/* ── Serialization ── */\n\nvoid usb_node_serialize(UsbNode *node, GByteArray *buffer);\n\n#endif /* USB_NODE_H */\n","Description":"Header for the UsbNode/UsbProp descriptor tree model, extracted from glib.c with fixed typedefs and added create_prop_u32.","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"/home/jcfaracco/Desktop/virt/usb_mentorship/usbredir/src/lib/usb_node.h","toolAction":"Creating usb_node.h","toolSummary":"UsbNode header file"}}]}
